                       "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><title>OWASP Juice Shop<\/title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"\"><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image\/x-icon\" href=\".\/assets\/public\/favicon_js.ico\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https:\/\/code.getmdl.io\/1.3.0\/material.min.css\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/icon?family=Material+Icons\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"http:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css?family=Roboto:300,400,500,700\" type=\"text\/css\"><script src=\"\/\/ajax.googleapis.com\/ajax\/libs\/jquery\/3.3.1\/jquery.min.js\"><\/script><script defer=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/code.getmdl.io\/1.3.0\/material.min.js\"><\/script><style>video {\nmin-width: 320px;\nwidth: 44vw;\ndisplay: block;\nmargin-left: auto;\nmargin-right:auto;\nmargin-bottom: 5px;\nheight: 50vh;\noutline: none;\n}\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .mdl-layout-title {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n}<\/style><\/head><body style=\"background: #303030;color:#FFFFFF;\"><div class=\"mdl-layout mdl-js-layout mdl-layout--fixed-header\"><header class=\"mdl-layout__header mdl-shadow--8dp\" style=\"background: #546E7A; height: auto; min-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; width: 100%;\"><div class=\"mdl-layout__header-row\"><a href=\".\/#\/\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration:none; margin-left: -50px;\"><i class=\"material-icons\" style=\"display: block;margin-bottom: auto;margin-top: auto; margin-right: 10px;\">arrow_back<\/i><\/a><a href=\".\/#\/\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"margin-right: 20px;\">Back<\/span><\/a><!-- Logo--><a href=\".\/#\/\"><img src=\"assets\/public\/images\/JuiceShop_Logo.png\" style=\"max-height: 60px; width: auto;\" alt=\"OWASP Juice Shop Logo\"><\/a><!-- Title--><a href=\".\/#\/\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration:none;\"><span class=\"mdl-layout-title\" style=\"font: 500 20px\/32px Roboto,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;,sans-serif;\">OWASP Juice Shop<\/span><\/a><\/div><\/header><\/div><section class=\"section--center mdl-grid mdl-grid--no-spacing\"><div class=\"mdl-card mdl-cell mdl-cell--12-col mdl-shadow--8dp\" id=\"card\" style=\"width: 45vw; min-width: 320px; height: 58vh; background: #424242; margin-bottom: 50px; margin-top: 110px; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right:auto; \"><h1 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 24px; line-height: 32px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin-left: 16px;\">Promotion Video<\/h1><video width=\"85vw\" height=\"240\" controls=\"controls\"><source src=\".\/video\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/div><\/section><script id=\"subtitle\" type=\"text\/vtt\" data-label=\"English\" data-lang=\"en\">WEBVTT\n\n00:00:01.396 --> 00:00:03.219\nOWASP is a non profit\n\n00:00:03.219 --> 00:00:06.564\nthat stands for the Open Web Application Security Project!\n\n00:00:07.218 --> 00:00:11.511\nOWASP is a community of developers, technologists and evangelists\n\n00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:14.314\nimproving the security of software through:\n\n00:00:14.782 --> 00:00:16.023\n1. Tools and Resources\t\n\n00:00:16.366 --> 00:00:19.736\nOWASP has 100+ active projects\n\n00:00:19.736 --> 00:00:22.580\nand new project applications are submitted weekly.\n\n00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:24.346\nProjects are open source\n\n00:00:24.346 --> 00:00:26.604\nand are built by our community of volunteers\n\n00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.173\n- people just like you!\n\n00:00:28.477 --> 00:00:30.210\n2. Community and Networking\t\n\n00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:33.704\nThere are hundreds of local chapters worldwide\n\n00:00:33.704 --> 00:00:35.096\nand thousands of members.\n\n00:00:35.362 --> 00:00:38.464\nMeetings are free and open to everyone.\n\n00:00:38.464 --> 00:00:39.558\nThey include:\n\n00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:40.642\n\u25CF Training\n\n00:00:40.642 --> 00:00:41.357\n\u25CF Talks\n\n00:00:41.357 --> 00:00:42.954\n\u25CF And networking opportunities\n\n00:00:43.673 --> 00:00:45.720\n3. Education \u0026 Training\n\n00:00:46.221 --> 00:00:49.012\nOWASP hosts many events each year.\n\n00:00:49.397 --> 00:00:50.973\nThey are a great way to:\n\n00:00:50.973 --> 00:00:52.394\n\u25CF Improve your skills\n\n00:00:52.394 --> 00:00:54.162\n\u25CF Build your professional network\n\n00:00:54.162 --> 00:00:56.678\n\u25CF And learn about new trends in the industry\n\n00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:01.005\nOne of many ways you can get involved is to become a member!\n\n00:01:01.283 --> 00:01:03.329\nThe membership benefits include:\n\n00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:05.893\n\u25CF Discounts for events and trainings\n\n00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:08.781\n\u25CF Your own OWASP email address\n\n00:01:08.781 --> 00:01:10.794\nand Google Workplace access\n\n00:01:11.313 --> 00:01:14.465\n\u25CF A vote in our OWASP Global Board elections\n\n00:01:14.861 --> 00:01:18.533\nAnd recently OWASP added a brand new member benefit!\n\n00:01:18.735 --> 00:01:22.304\nAccess to hands-on application security training\n\n00:01:22.304 --> 00:01:25.434\nthrough the OWASP SecureFlag Open Platform!\n\n00:01:26.282 --> 00:01:29.149\nJoin us and become a member today!\n\n<\/script><script>function parse_timestamp(s) {\nvar match = s.match(\/^(?:([0-9]+):)?([0-5][0-9]):([0-5][0-9](?:[.,][0-9]{0,3})?)\/);\nif (match == null) {\nthrow 'Invalid timestamp format: ' + s;\n}\nvar hours = parseInt(match[1] || \"0\", 10);\nvar minutes = parseInt(match[2], 10);\nvar seconds = parseFloat(match[3].replace(',', '.'));\nreturn seconds + 60 * minutes + 60 * 60 * hours;\n}\nfunction quick_and_dirty_vtt_or_srt_parser(vtt) {\nvar lines = vtt.trim().replace('\\\\r\\n', '\\n').split(\/[\\r\\n]\/).map(function(line) {\nreturn line.trim();\n});\nvar cues = [];\nvar start = null;\nvar end = null;\nvar payload = null;\nfor (var i = 0; i < lines.length; i++) {\nif (lines[i].indexOf('-->') >= 0) {\nvar splitted = lines[i].split(\/[ \\\\t]+-->[ \\t]+\/);\nif (splitted.length != 2) {\nthrow 'Error when splitting \"-->\": ' + lines[i];\n}\n\/\/ Already ignoring anything past the \"end\" timestamp (i.e. cue settings).\nstart = parse_timestamp(splitted[0]);\nend = parse_timestamp(splitted[1]);\n} else if (lines[i] == '') {\nif (start \u0026\u0026 end) {\nvar cue = new VTTCue(start, end, payload);\ncues.push(cue);\nstart = null;\nend = null;\npayload = null;\n}\n} else if(start \u0026\u0026 end) {\nif (payload == null) {\npayload = lines[i];\n} else {\npayload += '\\\\n' + lines[i];\n}\n}\n}\nif (start \u0026\u0026 end) {\nvar cue = new VTTCue(start, end, payload);\ncues.push(cue);\n}\nreturn cues;\n}\nfunction init() {\nvar video = document.querySelector('video');\nvar subtitle = document.getElementById('subtitle');\nvar track = video.addTextTrack('subtitles', subtitle.dataset.label, subtitle.dataset.lang);\ntrack.mode = \"showing\";\nquick_and_dirty_vtt_or_srt_parser(subtitle.innerHTML).map(function(cue) {\ntrack.addCue(cue);\n});\n}\ninit();<\/script><\/body><\/html>"
